  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, $\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 1}\\left(\\frac{1+x}{2+x}\\right)^{\\frac{1-\\sqrt{x}}{1-x}}$\r\n$=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 1}\\left(\\frac{1+x}{2+x}\\right)^{\\frac{1-\\sqrt{x}}{(1+\\sqrt x)(1- \\sqrt x)}}$\r\n$=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 1}\\left(\\frac{1+x}{2+x}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{1+\\sqrt{x}}}$\r\n$=\\left(\\frac{1+1}{2+1}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{1+1}}=\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}$",
    "image": null
  },
